# Lighthouse reports. They are ~600 KB of JSON per page per run and they are an ARTIFACT of a run,
# not a record of one: the workflow uploads them so a reviewer can open the exact report behind a
# score, and committing them would make every measurement a diff nobody reads.
.lighthouse/
.lighthouse-prove-red/
.auros-meta/
